---
The eFootball scene lives in WhatsApp groups and spreadsheets. Neekora turns it into one place where players find their people, enter competitions and build a record they can share.

Organisers publish a tournament from a template, players join from a shared link, check in and play. Both players confirm each result or raise a dispute with evidence, and the bracket updates itself. The full journey runs end to end in the live prototype on demo data, with simulated opponents, on the real competition engine. Accounts, the API and push notifications are the next milestone.
